<title>USA: Wendy's International Inc Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Wendy's International Inc Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN, Ohio 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.36		    $0.30</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.36		     0.29</p>
<p> Net			 46,941		   36,237</p>
<p> Revs		     506,575		  451,542</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     132,333		  122,513</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     132,554		  130,643</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.90		    $0.76</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.89		     0.74</p>
<p> Net			115,699		   91,912</p>
<p> Revs		   1,408,369		1,286,920</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     128,358		  121,604</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     131,643		  129,793</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 ended September 29, 1996; Q3 1995 ended October 1, 1995.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 fully diluted share results include a one-time charge of $0.01 per share for equipment and related asset writeoffs associated with product testing, and contractural obligations to a former employee.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
